        </div>
        <div class="pga-dialog__body">
          <div class="pga-dialog__note pga-dialog__note--blue">
            <v-icon size="13" color="#0891b2">mdi-information-outline</v-icon>
            <span>
              This adds a
              <strong
                >new independent {{ goalTypeLabel(addForm.goalType) }}</strong
              >. To <em>replace</em> an existing one, close this and use the
              <strong>pencil (edit)</strong> button on the goal you want to
